    ["Win.Malware.Packer"]="Packed malware, possibly concealing other payloads."
    ["Win.Trojan.Generic"]="Generic trojan behavior detected — could be multiple types."
    ["Win.Trojan.BazarLoader"]="Downloader for follow-up malware like Cobalt Strike or ransomware."
    ["Win.Trojan.Zusy"]="Trojan targeting banking data and user credentials."
    ["Win.Trojan.Remcos"]="Remcos trojan, used for remote access and surveillance."
    ["Win.Trojan.Emotet"]="Modular banking trojan, spreads via spam and drops other malware."
    ["Win.Trojan.AgentTesla"]="Keylogger and info-stealer, often spread via phishing emails."
